Firmware 19.0.0 moved acc:u0 TrySelectUserWithoutInteraction from command 51 to
command 52 (51 became TrySelectUserWithoutInteractionDeprecated). Both take the
same `u8 isNetworkServiceAccountRequired` and return the same `nn::account::Uid`,
so the existing handler is correct as-is -- it just is not reachable at the new
command id. Games built against a 19.x+ SDK call 52, hit
ServiceNotImplementedException, and abort the emulator.

--- a/src/Ryujinx.HLE/HOS/Services/Account/Acc/IAccountServiceForApplication.cs
+++ b/src/Ryujinx.HLE/HOS/Services/Account/Acc/IAccountServiceForApplication.cs
@@ -72,6 +72,7 @@
         }
 
         [CommandCmif(51)]
+        [CommandCmif(52)] // 19.0.0+
         // TrySelectUserWithoutInteraction(bool) -> nn::account::Uid
         public ResultCode TrySelectUserWithoutInteraction(ServiceCtx context)
         {
